    {
      "old_claim": "Prior C1 minimal_experiment: cur_a_main/cur_a_dur materially below 1 proves a large uncharged occupancy.",
      "corrected_claim": "Unsupported. cur_a_main counts only A-owned REQ_TRANS/AWAIT_RESP cycles; cur_a_dur counts the whole per-copy issue-to-done interval, which includes IDLE gaps, other DIDs, COMPLETE, and queue time. A low ratio is not proof of uncharged A translator service. COMPLETE A cycles are separately counted by cur_a_comp/cost_comp_q[1]; stale IDLE DID appears only in E2E.",
      "evidence": "dma_research_observer.sv:1041-1060,1528-1535; dma_research_policy.sv:290-293,328; rv_iommu_trans_ctl_wrap.sv:196,667-701."
